body:
Read C6 audit items 5/6. Small uncommitted production fixes only:
(a) bridge table fill missing/short record now sets e=BAD before cleanup (never returns success without submit);
(b) fau_count>128 now sets e and goes through cleanup, releasing command/TLS/WLS; no direct return/leak;
(c) TeguCommand execution only installs a compute NSError if failure is empty; encodeSignalEvent keeps the first error and never signals a foreign event. Host test asserts the first NSError survives a foreign event + teguExecute.
Tests: check_frontend_delta5 release+one ASan and check_compute_v2 bridge/real release+the same ASan set. No behavior change beyond refusals/leaks. HEAVY TAKE compute now, jobs=1; post hashes + release.
